      "writtenOn": "2024-09-11T14:19:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMHO we could even do more explicitly and have structure containing all the data that we reinterpret_cast as a bunch of uint32_t for setting via root constants:\n\n```\nstruct CommonImmediates {\n    uint32_t immedates[kMaxImmediates];\n    uint32_t bufferLength[kMaxDynamicBuffers];\n}\n\nstruct RenderImmediateValues : CommonImmediates {\n    uint32_t vertexIndexOffset;\n    uint32_t instanceIndexOffset;\n    // ...\n};\n\nclass CommonImmediates\u003cValue\u003e {\n  public:\n    const size_t kValueCount \u003d sizeof(Value) / sizeof(uin32_t);\n\n    // Const getters for calling setRootConstant, or retreiving the data for other purpose\n    const Value* operator -\u003e () const {return reinterpret_cast\u003cconst Value*\u003e(\u0026mData);}\n    const std::ityp_array\u003cuint32_t, kValueCount\u003e\u0026 AsUint32() const { ... }\n\n    // Setters\n    void SetImmediates(offset, count, uint32_t* values) {\n        for (ConstantIndex i : Range(count)) {\n            ConstantIndex index \u003d offset + i;\n            mDirty |\u003d index;\n            this-\u003eimmediates[i] \u003d values[index];\n        }\n    }\n    \n    void OnPipelineChange(PipelineD3D12 pipeline) {\n        mDirty |\u003d pipelineD3D12-\u003eGetConstantsMask();\n    }\n    \n    void SetRootConstants(Id3D12CommandList*, Mak pipelineConstantMask, Mask requiredConstant \u003d all) {\n        Mask constantsToApply \u003d mDirty \u0026 requiredConstant \u0026 pipelineConstantMask;\n        // Apply them\n        mDirty |\u003d ~constantsToApply;\n    }\n \n  protected:\n    // Only child class is allowed to mutate\n    operator -\u003e () {return reinterpret_cast\u003cValue*\u003e(\u0026mData);}\n    \n    // This is necessary to be char to not have UB\n    alignas(Value) char [kValueCount * sizeof(uin32_t)] mDataata;\n    ityp::bitset\u003ckValueCount, ConstantIndex\u003e mDirty;\n};\n\nclass RenderImmediates : CommonImmediates\u003c RenderImmediateValues \u003e {\n   void SetVertexAndInstanceIndex(uint32_t vertex, uint32_t instance) {\n        mDirty |\u003d ...;\n        this-\u003e vertexIndexOffset \u003d ...;\n        // same for instance\n    }\n};\n```\n\nThen when we do other backends we can see how much of that can be reused if at all.",
