      "message": "I mean d3d12::PipelineBase 😊 oh and we don\u0027t have it. I guess we can add that class similarly to PipelineGL https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/opengl/ComputePipelineGL.h;drc\u003d17ae9a413c120786d6e625bc126b6e62f8194d79;l\u003d41\n\nThis way we can store data that\u0027s the same in both compute and render pipelines while not adding it to the layout (because multiiple pipelines use the layout)",
      "parentUuid": "2f7b1af6_61c436d7",
      "revId": "1392ccb155b29453b7f1c581eb4f814d7ca830c0",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
